Lesson 8.11 · Marketing & Communications
Media relations and press materials

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
When nobody knows you yet, a launch or first result can be a local story worth telling.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Prepare a two-page press kit.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Build relationships with a few relevant journalists.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Never promise results you have not yet achieved.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You prepare your press kit checklist and first media list.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

